  "details": "In Febraury I was testing the Android version of VRChat and found out the “Mobile Hero” challenge (without knowing the order or the badges) and after some playing I got Mobile Hero on Febraury 16th (past midnight) and went to sleep…\n\nNext morning noticed a new challenge for Mobile Initiate and despite it being odd and kind of more simple i went on it just to notice that it wasn’t a new badge but a replacement for my Mobile Hero badge that got last night and not being able to get it back or redo the challenges to fix it.\n\nIf “Hero > Initiate” is right, then… Is it possible to revert the badges?\n\nRead on the Wiki that those are still in A/B testing so IDK if i found a fancy bug or it is what it is",
